  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects outcome is: &quot;Enhanced capacities of competent authorities and other stakeholders in supported countries for the sustainable development of aquaculture production, through improving systems to reduced biosecurity shocks and risks, and fostering enabling legal frameworks.&quot;</narrative>
